==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*15 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Zoge]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Croco]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
**2 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

